                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 374,
                            "playtime_at_review": 374,
                            "last_played": 1793378092
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'll start with the negative, because all of it happened at the get-go:\r\n1. This game only opened on 1/4 of my computer screen.  No matter what I tried, I could not get it to fullscreen viewing.  The Steam discussion group confirms this \"glitch\" in the system.\r\n2. This is a keyboard only game....no controller, no mouse.  \r\n3.  There is a brief note at the start about \"hidden stars\".  I normally don't go for all the hidden achievements in any game, I just want to 'git er done' but you have to find ALL the stars to play the last chapter in this game.....and they are extremely well hidden.  I went through a walkthrough to locate them all so I could finish this game.\r\nThat said, I had fun rolling this bowling ball through many scenarios and obstacles.  It required some thought to the physics of the problem and some finger dexterity to stop the ball, speed it up, etc.  This game was worth the low price and I'm glad I persisted through the onslaught of problems at the start.",
